<ArticleLayout
  title="Garage Software Pricing UK | GarageCloud Plans From £50/month"
  description="GarageCloud pricing: Starter at £50/month, Business at £100/month and Professional at £150/month, all excluding VAT. Compare plans and join the waiting list."
  eyebrow="Pricing"
  breadcrumbLabel="Pricing"
  heading="Garage management software pricing"
  lede="Three plans, priced per workshop rather than per vehicle or per job, so a busy week doesn't cost more than a quiet one."
>
  <p>
    Most UK garage software is priced in a way that punishes growth: per user, per vehicle, or with usage add-ons
    that only show up on the invoice. GarageCloud is priced per workshop instead — one flat monthly fee per plan,
    with unlimited staff and unlimited invoices on every tier.
  </p>

  <h2>How the three plans differ</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Starter</strong> at £50 a month covers the day-to-day running of a workshop: job cards, invoicing,
    quotes, expenses, reporting and accounting software API access. <strong>Business</strong> at £100 a month adds
    the tools that bring in more work — CRM, AI receptionist cover, websites and funnels, reputation management and
    a visual sales pipeline. <strong>Professional</strong> at £150 a month adds AI-assisted diagnostic tools on top
    of everything in Business.
  </p>

  <h2>What's not on the price list</h2>
  <p>
    No per-vehicle fee and no charge for extra staff logins on any plan. All prices exclude VAT. The plans below are
    current planned pricing, confirmed at launch — waiting list members hear first if anything changes before then.
  </p>

  <h2>Which plan is right for a small workshop?</h2>
  <p>
    An independent garage or <a href="/mot-test-centre-software">MOT centre</a> running day-to-day operations
    without needing marketing tools usually fits Starter. A workshop that wants to actively bring in new customers
    — through CRM, reviews and a booking funnel — is better suited to Business. Professional makes sense once
    diagnostics are a regular part of the job mix. See what <a href="/garage-management-software">garage management software</a> covers for more on what's included.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="full-width">
    <PricingSection />
